---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PinnedSticker from "../components/PinnedSticker.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="关于我" description="关于我与这个开发日志。">
  <article class="about-page">
    <header class="about-heading">
      <h1>关于我</h1>
      <PinnedSticker
        class="about-plush-sticker"
        src="assets/stickers/sheep-plush.webp"
        label="摆动羊毛绒娃娃贴纸"
        width={859}
        height={1475}
        fastener="tape"
        tone="copper"
      />
    </header>
    <div class="about-columns prose">
      <section>
        <h2>这个博客写什么</h2>
        <p>记录角色与网页 AI 工作流 学习工具和桌面应用从想法到可用版本的过程</p>
      </section>
      <section class="about-contact-section">
        <h2>在哪里找到我</h2>
        <p>代码和公开项目都放在 GitHub</p>
        <p class="about-contact-note"><a href="https://github.com/WeihanChen000">github.com/WeihanChen000 &nearr;</a></p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
